            "TextSectionType": "Definition",
            "Contents": "A rare syndrome with a brainstem malformation as a major feature characterized by a mild-to-moderate sensorineural bilateral hearing loss motor delay balance impairment tremor and schooling difficulties. Brain MRI shows a distinctive abnormal brainstem morphology."
